:"The Globe and Mail","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""},{"title":"What FirstEnergy (FE) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNWkgtM1otZEZrQzY1c2VSWUNLZzR3WGp5Ykc2Z2lFM3pOaU1GNFAyVmpfaGpMN25yZjg0S0VZV1FQR0s3YkF5cEJLLXZwcmNsT1lHd2tvUVlKSDZlbzVRNDhhdjhScWtpMk9OSF9CbVc1cENsMUpKZTRaM2hXNTJTMWQtZWxkTXF0NDUwVkxFdUVjOFlGQjhtUHlFREd6czhhRGlpSGFxWll4TVdW?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""},{"title":"FirstEnergy's data center demand nearly doubles in less than year","src":"Akron Beacon Journal","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":"FirstEnergy 的資料中心需求在不到一年的時間內幾乎翻了一番"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":11},{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"資料中心","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":1},{"name":"電動車","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1031296/000103129626000046/fe-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"FE and its subsidiaries are principally involved in the transmission, distribution, and generation of electricity. FirstEnergy's electric operating companies comprise one of the nation's largest investor-owned electric systems, serving over six million customers in the Midwest and Mid-Atlantic regions. FirstEnergy's transmission operations include more than 24,000 miles of transmission lines and two regional transmission operation centers, and MP and AGC control 3,610 MWs of total generation capacity.","zh":"富裕及其子公司主要從事電力的傳輸、分配和發電。 FirstEnergy 的電力營運公司是美國最大的投資者擁有的電力系統之一，為中西部和中大西洋地區超過 600 萬客戶提供服務。 FirstEnergy 的輸電業務包括超過 24,000 英里的輸電線路和兩個區域輸電營運中心，MP 和 AGC 控制著 3,610 兆瓦的總發電容量。"},{"en":"The Electric Companies' combined service areas encompass approximately 65,000 square miles in Ohio, Pennsylvania, West Virginia, Maryland, New Jersey, and New York, providing distribution services for over six million customers in an area with a population of approximately 14 million and a total rate base of approximately $21.3 billion as of December 31, 2025.","zh":"電力公司的合併服務區域涵蓋俄亥俄州、賓夕法尼亞州、西維吉尼亞州、馬裡蘭州、新澤西州和紐約州約 65,000 平方英里，為該地區人口約 1,400 萬的超過 600 萬客戶提供配送服務，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，總費率基數約為 213 億美元。"},{"en":"OE owns property and does business as an electric public utility in Ohio, providing distribution services to approximately 1.1 million customers in central and northeastern Ohio, with a rate base of $2.0 billion as of December 31, 2025. OE has 1,013 employees and serves an area that has a population of approximately 2.4 million.","zh":"OE 在俄亥俄州擁有財產並作為一家電力公用事業公司開展業務，為俄亥俄州中部和東北部的約 110 萬客戶提供配電服務，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，費率基數為 20 億美元。 OE 擁有 1,013 名員工，服務於人口約 240 萬的地區。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"MP owns property and does business as an electric public utility in West Virginia, providing distribution services to approximately 0.4 million customers, as well as generation and transmission services in northern West Virginia, with a combined rate base of $4.1 billion as of December 31, 2025. MP has 968 employees and serves an area with a population of approximately 0.8 million. MP is contractually obligated to provide power to PE to meet its load obligations in West Virginia. MP owns or contractually controls 3,610 MWs of generation capacity that is supplied to its electric utility business, including 30 MWs of Solar generation and 487 MWs of pumped-storage hydroelectric generation from its 16.25% undivided interest in the Bath County facility in Virginia through its wholly owned subsidiary AGC.","zh":"MP 在西維吉尼亞州擁有財產並作為一家電力公用事業公司開展業務，為約 40 萬客戶提供配電服務，以及西維吉尼亞州北部的發電和輸電服務，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，綜合費率基數為 41 億美元。 MP 擁有 968 名員工，服務於人口約 80 萬的地區。 MP 有合約義務向 PE 提供電力，以滿足其在西維吉尼亞州的負荷義務。 MP 透過其全資子公司 AGC 擁有或透過合約控制了 3,610 兆瓦的發電能力，供應給其電力公用事業業務，其中包括 30 兆瓦的太陽能發電和 487 兆瓦的抽水蓄能分割水力發電，這些發電能力來自其通過其全資子公司 AGC 持有的弗吉尼亞州巴斯縣設施 16.25% 的不可權益。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Within FirstEnergy's Electric Companies' distribution business, including JCP&L, there generally is no competition for electric distribution service in the Electric Companies' respective service territories in Ohio, Pennsylvania, West Virginia, Maryland, New Jersey and New York. Additionally, pursuant to FERC's Order No. 1000 and subject to state and local siting and permitting approvals, non-incumbent developers can compete for certain PJM transmission projects in the service territories of certain of FirstEnergy's Electric Companies' providing transmission services, including JCP&L, and the Transmission Companies. This has resulted in additional competition to build transmission facilities in the respective service territories while also allowing the opportunity to seek to build facilities in non-incumbent service territories.","zh":"在 FirstEnergy 的電力公司的配電業務（包括 JCP&L）中，電力公司各自的服務區域（俄亥俄州、賓夕法尼亞州、西維吉尼亞州、馬裡蘭州、新澤西州和紐約州）的配電服務通常不存在競爭。此外，根據 FERC 的第 1000 號命令，並經州和地方選址和許可批准，非現有開發商可以在 FirstEnergy 的某些提供輸電服務的電力公司（包括 JCP&L 和輸電公司）的服務區域內競爭某些 PJM 輸電項目。這導致了在各自服務區域建設傳輸設施的額外競爭，同時也提供了尋求在非現有服務區域建設設施的機會。"},{"en":"The sale of electric power is generally a seasonal business, and weather patterns can have, and have in the past had, a material impact on FirstEnergy's Electric Companies' operating results, including JCP&L. Demand for electricity in their service territories historically peaks during the summer and winter months. Accordingly, the Registrants' annual results of operations and liquidity position may depend disproportionately on its operating performance during the summer and winter. Mild weather conditions may result in lower power sales, and consequently, lower revenue, earnings and cash flow.","zh":"電力銷售通常是季節性業務，天氣模式可能並且過去曾經對 FirstEnergy 的電力公司（包括 JCP&L）的經營業績產生重大影響。歷史上，其服務區域的電力需求在夏季和冬季達到高峰。因此，註冊人的年度營運表現和流動性狀況可能不成比例地取決於其夏季和冬季的營運表現。溫和的天氣條件可能會導致電力銷售下降，從而導致收入、收益和現金流下降。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Regulated Distribution","val":7547000000,"zh":"監理分配"},{"name":"Integrated","val":5683000000,"zh":"綜合部門"},{"name":"Integrated","val":5683000000,"zh":"融合的"},{"name":"Stand Alone Transmission","val":1905000000,"zh":"獨立傳輸段"},{"name":"Regulated Transmission","val":1905000000,"zh":"調節傳輸"}],"total":15090000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity Us Regulated","val":12189000000,"zh":"美國電力監管"},{"name":"Electric Transmission","val":2311000000,"zh":"電動傳動"},{"name":"Electric Worldwide Unregulated Revenue","val":590000000,"zh":"電力全球不受監管的收入"}],"total":15090000000}},"peers":["ETR","EXC","AEP","EIX","DTE"]}}